Team names, logos and marks
---------------------------

Club names, logos, wordmarks and colours are the property of their respective
clubs and leagues. They appear here to identify the club a player belongs to —
nominative use — and no claim of ownership is made.

This includes, but is not limited to:

  - The club logos committed under src/lib/assets/logos/ (NHL, OHL, PWHL, QMJHL
    and WHL club marks).
  - The club names and brand colours in src/lib/team-names.ts and
    src/lib/team-colors.ts.
  - Club logos and player photographs loaded at runtime from league-operated
    CDNs, which are not redistributed by this project.

If you are a rights holder and would like something removed, please open an
issue at https://github.com/jamincan/numbrrs.


Data sources
------------

Roster and team data is retrieved from public league endpoints:

  - NHL          https://api-web.nhle.com/v1
  - PWHL, WHL,   https://lscluster.hockeytech.com/feed/index.php
    OHL, QMJHL   (HockeyTech "modulekit" feed)

This project has no formal relationship with, and makes no warranty about,
either source. The HockeyTech API keys in src/lib/server/leagues/ are the ones
published by the leagues' own public websites; they are not secrets.


